{"id":"P027-1","subject":"P","unit":"P027","unitTitle":"2024 상반기 · 24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 51~60문항","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P027-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 51번","searchText":" 51\n\n시간함수 sin의 라플라스 변환은?\n\n\n                                 \n①            ② \n\n                                 \n③            ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e06-m51","number":51},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m51-q.webp","width":678,"height":480},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m51-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P027-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 52번","searchText":" 52\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 충분히 긴 시간이 지난 상태에서\n\n인 순간에 스위치를 에서 로 이동하는 경우,\nA과 V의 값은?\n\n\n\n\n\n            A              V\n\n ①            5                    5\n\n ②            5                   15\n\n ③           15                   5\n\n ④           15                  15","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e06-m52","number":52},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m52-q.webp","width":678,"height":690},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m52-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1072}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P027-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 53번","searchText":" 53\n\n위험지역의 분류에 따라 적용가능한 방폭구조에서,\n\nZone 0로 구분되는 위험지역에 적용가능한 방폭구조는?\n\n\n① 본질안전 방폭구조   ② 내압 방폭구조\n\n③ 안전증 방폭구조    ④ 비점화 방폭구조","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e06-m53","number":53},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m53-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m53-e1.webp","width":678,"height":810}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P027-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 54번","searchText":" 54\n\n건축물, 구조물과 분리되지 않은 피뢰시스템의 경우, 병렬\n\n인하도선의 최대 간격은 피뢰시스템 등급 II에서 몇 m인\n\n가?\n\n\n① 10          ② 15\n\n③ 20          ④ 25","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e06-m54","number":54},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m54-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m54-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1265}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P027-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 55번","searchText":" 55\n\n회전날개의 지름이 40m인 프로펠러형 풍차 발전기의\n\n풍속이 20ms일 때, 풍력 에너지는 몇 kW인가?\n(단, 공기의 밀도는 1.2kgm으로 한다.)\n\n\n①         ② \n\n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e06-m55","number":55},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m55-q.webp","width":696,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m55-e1.webp","width":696,"height":617}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P027-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 56번","searchText":" 56\n\n다음과 같은 ‘방전전류-시간특성곡선’을 갖는 부하에 필요한\n\n축전지의 용량은 약 몇 Ah인가? (단, 보수율은 이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n             - 방전전류-               - 용량환산시간-\n      ⦁A          ⦁h\n      ⦁A          ⦁h\n      ⦁A          ⦁h\n\n① 22          ② 27\n\n③ 34          ④ 48","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e06-m56","number":56},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m56-q.webp","width":678,"height":1130},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m56-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P027-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 57번","searchText":" 57\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 출력전압 은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① -12          ② -16\n\n③ -24          ④ -32","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e06-m57","number":57},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m57-q.webp","width":678,"height":752},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m57-e1.webp","width":696,"height":981}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P027-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 58번","searchText":" 58\n\n태양광 발전과 태양열 발전의 차이에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않\n\n은 것은?\n\n\n① 태양광 발전은 빛에너지를 활용한 것이며, 태양열 발전\n\n  은 열에너지를 활용한 것이다.\n\n② 태양광 발전은 인버터를 필요로 하나, 태양열 발전은\n\n  인버터를 필요로 하지 않는다.\n\n③ 태양광 발전은 발전시설을 설치하는 장소와 크기에\n\n  제약이 있으나, 태양열 발전은 제약이 적다.\n\n④ 태양광 발전은 열을 이용하여 증기를 만들어 전기를\n\n  발생시켜야 하는 태양열 발전과 달리 태양전지 패널을\n\n  이용하여 전기를 생산하므로 비용이 저렴하다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e06-m58","number":58},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m58-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m58-e1.webp","width":696,"height":901}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P027-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 59번","searchText":" 59\n\n발전부문이 분할되면서 발전부분의 경쟁환경을 지향한 자\n\n율적 사업계획을 바탕으로 전력수급기본계획이 수립되었다.\n\n에너지 안보를 위한 안정적인 전력수급을 최우선 과제로\n\n경제성, 환경성, 안정성이 함께 고려된 전력수급기본계획의\n\n수립절차로 옳은 것은?\n\n       ㉠ 분야별 실무위원회 구성\n\n       ㉡ 계획수립 기준정립\n\n       ㉢ 수요전망\n\n       ㉣ 발전설비 현황조사\n\n\n\n① ㉠ - ㉡ - ㉢ - ㉣   ② ㉠ - ㉢ - ㉡ - ㉣\n\n③ ㉢ - ㉣ - ㉡ - ㉠   ④ ㉢ - ㉠ - ㉡ - ㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e06-m59","number":59},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m59-q.webp","width":696,"height":758},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m59-e1.webp","width":678,"height":588}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P027-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인) · 객관식 60번","searchText":" 60\n\n극수가 6이고, 극당 자속수가 0.01, 전기자 도체수가\n\n400인 단중 중권 직류 발전기가 1200rpm으로 회전할\n\n때, 유도 기전력은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 80          ② 120\n\n③ 160         ④ 240","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.03.09 한국중부발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e06-m60","number":60},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m60-q.webp","width":696,"height":442},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e06-m60-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1294}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
